    <description><![CDATA[
      <h3>Elesium Enterprise AI Architecture Hub — Delhi NCR</h3>
      <p><b>Address:</b> Cyber City, DLF Phase 2, Building 10, Gurugram, Haryana 122002</p>
      <p><b>Google Maps CID:</b> <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=11928374659283746519">11928374659283746519</a></p>
      <p><b>Official Entity URL:</b> <a href="https://elesium.online/enterprise-ai-delhi-ncr/">https://elesium.online/enterprise-ai-delhi-ncr/</a></p>
      <p><b>Autonomous AI Engineering:</b> Multi-Agent LangGraph Systems, Sovereign LLM Deployment, DPDP Act 2023 Compliance.</p>
      <iframe width="480" height="270" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLelesium-enterprise" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    ]]></description>
